==Trivia== 
* [[Professor Oak's Pokémon Live Caster]]: {{p|Minccino}}{{tt|*|Japanese DVD realases only}}.
** There is no [[Professor Oak's Pokémon Live Caster]] following this episode, instead being replaced with a trailer for both editions of the [[M14|fourteenth movie]].
* The "To Be Continued" caption appears at the upper edge of the screen instead of the usual lower edge.
* This episode aired on June 22, 2011 in {{pmin|Italy}} on Disney XD, three days before it aired in {{pmin|the United States}}.
* This episode reveals that the [[Officer Jenny]]s working in the [[Unova]] [[region]] use {{p|Swanna}} as assistants.
* This is the first episode in the {{pkmn|animated series}} to not feature any {{type|Normal}} Pokémon.
* Music from ''[[M12|Arceus and the Jewel of Life]]'' is used as background music.

